# Trip Up: "Target nonland permanent's owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library." Bot2's Island is a land
# and is refused as a target; Bot2's Ornithopter is chosen. Bot2, its owner, accepts: the Ornithopter goes on top of Bot2's library,
# not into its graveyard, and is not countered or destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Trip Up
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Trip Up.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Trip Up.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Accept

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Island
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Library.Top = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Trip Up
